<html lang="et">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<title>Karl Jakob Proso, veebiprogrammeerimine</title>
	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/gallery.css">
	<script> src="/script/gallery.js" defer=</script>
</head>
<body>
	<img src="/pic/veebiprogrammeerimine_2026_TA.png" alt ="banner">	<h1>Karl Jakob Proso, veebiprogrammeerimine</h1>
	<h1>Galerisse fotod</h1>
	<p>Siin lehel saab galeriis vaadata fotosi.</p>
	<hr>
	<ul>
		<li><a href="/home">Avalehele</a></li>
		<li><a href="/logout">Logi välja</a></li>
	</ul>
	
		<hr>
		<dialog id="modal" class="modalarea">
			<span id="modalClose" class="modalclose">&times;</span>
